window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>With Celeste missing, Viktor’s focus has turned to nothing but her return. Dragging Amelia halfway around the world on a mission to find his immortal child, he’s become distant and aloof, placing an invisible wall between the two of them.</p> <p>Returning to the States, Amelia is reminded that the only constant in her life has been herself. With Hypatia in New Orleans and the possible resurgence of the cult, she is once again thrown into a fight she never planned on.</p> <p>When a new threat appears, she learns that her childhood and heritage are much more than she could have ever imagined. With the help of the future Alpha of New Orleans, Amelia becomes something she never could have imagined and learns who she truly is.</p>"; 
